        <h1>Shona bible app</h1>
        <p class="promise" itemprop="description">Ndima imwe yeShoko raMwari zuva nezuva, pamufananidzo wakanaka wezvisikwa zvake.</p>
        <p>Vhura Albamu re Bhaibheri uone ndima yanhasi yakanyorwa zvakanaka pamufananidzo unozadza sikirini yose: makomo, makungwa, masango kana denga. Hapana runyorwa rwezvinhu zvinoramba zvichiuya, hapana kupuruzira uchidzika, uye hapana dura remabhuku. Ingori ndima imwe chete yezuva iroro, yokuti umbomira uifungisise.</p>
        <p class="text-wrap">Isa kadhi kendima pachidzitiro chekutanga chefoni yako, kuti Shoko rive pedyo paunotanga zuva. Goverana mufananidzo wendima paWhatsApp nekungobata kamwe chete.</p>
        <p>Pamutauro mumwe nomumwe pane ndima 1,689 dzakanyatsosarudzwa. Dzinobuda imwe pazuva, kwemakore anenge mana nehafu imwe isati yadzokororwa. Pamutauro wega wega panoshandiswa shanduro imwe yeBhaibheri isisina kodzero dzemunyori dzinoirambidza kushandiswa neruzhinji.</p>
