    <section class="panel devotional">
      <p>Pakumuka, usati watanga mabasa ezuva, ipa Shoko raMwari nguva. Verenga ndima yanhasi zvishoma nezvishoma, woenda nayo mumunyengetero kuna Ishe. Runako rwemakomo, mvura nemiti ngaruyeuchidze mwoyo wako nezveMusiki. Mufananidzo hausi kutsiva Shoko; unokukoka kuti umbomira, uteerere, uye utange zuva uchivimba naMwari.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel widgets" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowTo">
      <h2 itemprop="name">Isa ndima yanhasi paunoiona zviri nyore</h2>
      <p itemprop="description">Kadhi kepachidzitiro chekutanga kanoratidza ndima yanhasi nemufananidzo wayo pa iOS ne Android. Kuvakawanda, iyi ndiyo nzira yavanoverenga nayo zuva nezuva vasina kutanga vavhura Albamu re Bhaibheri.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
          <h3 itemprop="name">Tora Albamu re Bhaibheri</h3>
          <p itemprop="text">Sarudza App Store kana Google Play pamusoro apa, uiise mufoni yako, woivhura. Haufaniri kunyoresa kana kugadzira akaundi.</p>
        </li>
        <li itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
          <h3 itemprop="name">Wedzera kadhi kendima</h3>
          <p itemprop="text">Bata kwenguva duku nzvimbo isina chinhu pachidzitiro chekutanga. Vhura panowedzerwa makadhi epachidzitiro, sarudza Bible Album, woisa kadhi panzvimbo yaunoda.</p>
        </li>
        <li itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
          <h3 itemprop="name">Verenga paunotarisa foni</h3>
          <p itemprop="text">Ndima yanhasi nemufananidzo zvinenge zviri ipapo. Pa iOS unogonawo kuwedzera kadhi paunogadzirisa chidzitiro chinooneka foni yakakiyiwa.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="small">Mazita ezvisarudzo nenhanho dzacho zvinogona kusiyana zvichienderana nefoni yako. Kadhi repachidzitiro chakakiyiwa rinowanikwa pa iOS chete.</p>
    </section>

