      <h2>Mibvunzo inowanzobvunzwa</h2>
      <div class="question" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <h3 itemprop="name">Ndeyemahara here?</h3>
        <div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Hongu. Albamu re Bhaibheri remufoni nderemahara pa iOS ne Android, harina zviziviso zvekutengesa uye haridi akaundi. Hariunganidzi mashoko ako kana kutevera zvaunoita. Kana waiisa, unogona kuverenga ndima nemifananidzo usina indaneti. Kutumira mufananidzo paWhatsApp kunoda indaneti. Bhuku remagetsi, Albamu re Bhaibheri, ndiro rinotengwa rakaparadzana.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="question" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <h3 itemprop="name">Iri ndiro Bhaibheri rose here?</h3>
        <div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Kwete. Kana uchitsvaga bhaibheri rechishona rose, Albamu re Bhaibheri harisi iro. Harisiwo Bhaibheri rokudzidza zvakadzama: harina zvinonzwika, zvirongwa zvokuverenga, tsananguro dzendima, nzvimbo yokunyora manotsi, kutsvaga kana nzvimbo yokukurukura nevamwe. Rinongoratidza ndima imwe pazuva pamufananidzo. Hariratidzi chiShona nechiRungu padivi nepadivi. Kana uchida mumwe mutauro, ona <a href="https://biblealbum.org/english">peji rechiRungu</a> kana <a href="https://biblealbum.org/chichewa">peji reChichewa</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
